      "description": "<p>Stevens’s decision sparked fierce backlash from members of the party, while Donald Trump praised the sudden switch</p><p>Democrat Haley Stevens’s shocking last-minute endorsement of Mike Rogers, the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/michigan\">Michigan</a> Republican Senate candidate, in the run-up to Tuesday’s midterm elections has sparked fierce backlash from members of her party.</p><p>Stevens, who narrowly lost in the Democratic primary for Senate to Abdul El-Sayed, announced her support for Rogers after a feud with the El-Sayed campaign over an outside group’s advertisement, which blamed the high cost of living on US support for Israel.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/02/democrats-reaction-haley-steven-mike-rogers\">Continue reading...</a>",
